## 2. Relay

Relay from `code-writer` (Google Antigravity, Gemini 3.8 Flash, effort high) to `adversarial-reviewer` (Grok 4.7 high):

Attempt 2 addresses all five blockers and seven nits in branch `lab/crawdad-ground-v1`:
- Blocker 1: No-code revision replies record distinct stop reason `no_code`, preserving the arm's last non-empty module as the final program in both G and C (`ground.py:539-551`, `643-654`; `test_ground.py:276-318`).
- Blocker 2: Hard pre-call token cap skips any call where `tokens_so_far + MAX_TOKENS > TASK_BUDGET` (24576) with stop reason `budget` across both arms, including test-gen in G (`ground.py:460-471`, `521-524`, `625-628`; `test_ground.py:320-349`). Total completion tokens guaranteed $\le 24576$.
- Blocker 3: Union loop variable renamed from `sp` to `passed_union`, fixing summary path clobbering (`ground.py:791-794`, `887`). Added end-to-end report tests for `keep`, `drop`, `inconclusive`, and `no_room` (`test_ground.py:393-455`).
- Blocker 4: `status_line()` invites the first seat in `ORDER` owing work (`ground.py:713`). Expected status line updated to `owed {'qwen32': 0, 'r1d32': 270}; next session: invite r1d32` with units explained (3 actions/task $\times$ 90 = 270) (`docs/crawdad-ground-v1.md:162`; `test_ground.py:457-473`).
- Blocker 5: Execution feedback isolated. Both arms scored on LAST non-empty module; G-best-of-N logged as secondary package result without verdict. Both arms receive identical `REVISION_INSTRUCTION` (G adds error block). Stop rules matched (`budget`, `max_turns`, `no_code`, `repeat_code`; G retains execution-driven `all_pass`). Test-writing kept G-only and counted against G's budget. Protocol hash updated to `a7efb2060615` (`ground.py:98`, `docs:83`).
- Nits: ExplodingTask broadened (raises on `.get()`, items/values/keys, iter, copy); prompt scanner test asserts no hidden lines, ref substrings $\ge 20$ chars, or `"104729"` reach prompts (`test_ground.py:99-248`); token totals checked in budget test; static tier documented as compile + deny_check + entry points (`ground.py:138`, `docs:68`); d4 triad kept as placeholder (`docs:107`); visible counts corrected to formats 237, simulation_dp 124 (total 724) (`docs:30-35`); `v10_39`/`v10_66` unbound variable comments added (`generate_visible.py:201-205`, `docs:38`); GPU hours recomputed from v8-d2 (227.7 s/reply, 13/60 solo pass rate applied to failing revisions: 41.29 h expected, 91.09 h worst case) (`docs:113-143`).
- Checks: all 9 suites passed on CPU under `prlimit --as=4294967296`. Working tree dirty, uncommitted.

